          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"recipe = \" /><text value=\"&quot;flour salt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"recipe = recipe + \" /><text value=\"&quot; pepper&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(recipe)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"flour salt pepper\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>flour salt pepper</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>pepper flour salt</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>list pepper</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>flour salt pepper</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La console mostra <code>flour salt pepper</code>. Quale seconda riga le farebbe visualizzare invece <code>pepper flour salt</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"recipe = \" /><text value=\"&quot;flour salt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"recipe = recipe + \" /><text value=\"&quot; pepper&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(recipe)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"flour salt pepper\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>recipe = \"pepper \" + recipe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>recipe = recipe + \" pepper\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>recipe = \"pepper\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>recipe = \"pepper \" + recipe</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
