            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"languages = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"languages += \" /><text value=\"&quot; SQL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(languages)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Python SQL\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Python SQL</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SQL Python</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nothing is printed in the console</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Python SQL</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>languages += \" SQL\"</code> prima che il valore venga visualizzato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"languages = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"languages += \" /><text value=\"&quot; SQL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(languages)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Python SQL\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiunge <code> SQL</code> dopo la stringa attuale e memorizza il risultato.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiunge <code> SQL</code> prima della stringa attuale e memorizza il risultato.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisce la stringa attuale con <code> SQL</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiunge <code> SQL</code> dopo la stringa attuale e memorizza il risultato.</p></body></html>"
