            "id": 78651,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che questo ciclo <code>while</code> ripeta il suo blocco di codice mentre <code>is_electric</code> è uguale a <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_electric = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_electric == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boogie woogie woogie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  is_electric = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Boogie woogie woogie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>is_electric</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>True:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai eseguire a questo ciclo <code>while</code> il suo blocco finché <code>is_electric</code> è uguale a <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_electric = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_electric == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boogie woogie woogie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  is_electric = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Boogie woogie woogie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>is_electric</code>, seguito da <code>==</code> e infine <code>True:</code>.</p></body></html>",
